+C03: AUDIO1579 adjudicated, «subí el volumen y decime qué fecha es» gives the date and asks how much, 1 credit (535/742)
+
+Five cases on BUILD1579 (HEAD 7bb180bd): «subí el volumen y decime qué fecha es» and both variants («bajá el volumen y decime qué hora es», «Decime qué fecha es y subí el volumen.») decided a single verified system.time read, changed no volume, and their first drafts were published as finals: the observed date or time followed by one question for the amount («Hoy es 15 de septiembre de 2026. ¿Cuánto querías aumentar el volumen?», «14:33, ¿cuánto querés bajar el volumen?»). The App's InventedVolume rule now judges only the sentences before that trailing question when the person's request named the volume. The two boundaries passed with zero operations: the bare relative request asked the amount, and «No toques el volumen.» was acknowledged («Entendido, no tocaré el volumen.») now that «toca» counts as a prohibited action. 1 credit (H0067, both variants approved); registry 535/742, 207 open, 0 NA; «Audio y volumen» 46/51.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
+
